### ── CREATE POST ─────────────────────────

### 1. Create a post with description only
POST http://localhost:6435/post-api/createpost
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "This is my first post!"
}

###

### 2. Create post with empty description (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:6435/post-api/createpost
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": ""
}

###

### ── EDIT POST ───────────────────────────

### 3. Edit own post description (replace POST_ID)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/editpost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Updated description for my post"
}

###

### 6. Edit post with empty description (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/editpost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": ""
}

###

### 7. Edit someone else's post (should return 403)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/editpost/SOMEONE_ELSES_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Trying to edit someone else's post"
}

###

### 8. Edit a deleted post (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/editpost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Editing deleted post"
}

###

### 9. Edit non-existent post (should return 404)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/editpost/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Ghost post edit"
}

###


### ── VIEW POST ───────────────────────────


### 10. View a post by ID (replace POST_ID)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/viewpost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 11. View a soft-deleted post (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/viewpost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 12. View post with invalid ID format (should return 400 CastError)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/viewpost/invalidid123
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 13. View non-existent post (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/viewpost/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── POST COUNT ──────────────────────────


### 14. Get post count for a user by username
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/count/admin1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 15. Get post count for non-existent username (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/count/ghostuser999
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── DELETE POST (soft) ──────────────────


### 16. Soft delete own post (replace POST_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delpost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 17. Delete someone else's post (should return 403)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delpost/SOMEONE_ELSES_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 18. Delete already deleted post (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delpost/ALREADY_DELETED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 19. Delete non-existent post (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delpost/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── RECOVER POST ────────────────────────


### 20. Recover a soft-deleted post (replace POST_ID)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/recover/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 21. Recover a post that is not deleted (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/recover/ACTIVE_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 22. Recover someone else's post (should return 403)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/recover/SOMEONE_ELSES_DELETED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── LIKE POST ───────────────────────────


### 23. Like a post (replace POST_ID)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/likepost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 24. Like a post you already liked (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/likepost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 25. Like a deleted post (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/likepost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 26. Like non-existent post (should return 404)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/likepost/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── UNLIKE POST ─────────────────────────


### 27. Unlike a post you liked (replace POST_ID)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/unlikepost/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 28. Unlike a post you haven't liked (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/unlikepost/NOT_LIKED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 29. Unlike a deleted post (should return 400)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/post-api/unlikepost/DELETED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── GET LIKES LIST ──────────────────────


### 30. Get likes list of a post
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/likes/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 31. Get likes of deleted post (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/likes/DELETED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── ADD COMMENT ─────────────────────────


### 32. Add a comment to a post (replace POST_ID)
POST http://localhost:6435/post-api/comment/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "comment": "This is a great post!"
}

###

### 33. Add empty comment (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:6435/post-api/comment/POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "comment": ""
}

###

### 34. Add comment to deleted post (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:6435/post-api/comment/DELETED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "comment": "Commenting on deleted post"
}

###

### 35. Add comment to non-existent post (should return 404)
POST http://localhost:6435/post-api/comment/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "comment": "Ghost comment"
}

###


### ── GET COMMENTS LIST ───────────────────


### 36. Get comments list of a post
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/comments/69faf3e5d45530b84f0b294e
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 37. Get comments of deleted post (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/comments/DELETED_POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── DELETE COMMENT ──────────────────────


### 38. Delete own comment (replace POST_ID and COMMENT_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delcomment/POST_ID/69faf53ed45530b84f0b2950
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 39. Delete someone else's comment (should return 403)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delcomment/POST_ID/SOMEONE_ELSES_COMMENT_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 40. Delete comment on non-existent post (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delcomment/000000000000000000000000/COMMENT_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 41. Delete non-existent comment (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delcomment/POST_ID/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 42. Delete comment from deleted post (should return 400)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/post-api/delcomment/DELETED_POST_ID/COMMENT_ID
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── FOLLOWING FEED ──────────────────────


### 43. Get following feed — page 1
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/feed
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 44. Get following feed — page 2
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/feed?page=2&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 45. Get feed when following no one (should return empty array)
### (Use an account that follows nobody)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/feed
Content-Type: application/json

###


### ── EXPLORE FEED ────────────────────────


### 46. Get explore feed — page 1 (all posts, blocked/deactivated users excluded)
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/explore
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 47. Get explore feed — page 2
GET http://localhost:6435/post-api/explore?page=2&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###
